sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Caller
  participant P as Pipeline
  participant E as Evidence/Assumptions
  participant O as Ops+Links
  participant Q as MC UQ
  U->>P: request + mode
  P->>E: resolve active params
  alt active
    E->>O: apply_operation
    O->>Q: propagate_metric_only
    Q-->>U: density summary
  else inactive
    P-->>U: NA + qualitative
  end
